Cc: devicetree@vger.kernel.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org, dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org, linux-sunxi@googlegroups.com, =?UTF-8?q?Cl=C3=A9ment=20P=C3=A9ron?= <peron.clem@gmail.com>
